1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"library--intensive-listening","kind":"library-article","route":"/roadmap/library/intensive-listening","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/library/intensive-listening","sourceHash":"713962e55ba567185608646615edb39ebac75cc12b7b87bef8af4e5dfbff65b2","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T16:53:10.924Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"Intensive Listening","zh":"精听"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Intensive listening is a style of interactive listening where you listen to content without text, pausing frequently to check whether you understood, and using subtitles as a fallback when you're stuck.","zh":"精听是一种互动式听力练习：在没有文本的情况下听内容，并频繁暂停，检查自己是否听懂；遇到困难时，再把字幕作为备用手段。"}},{"id":"segment-0002","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"There is a whole \"family\" of activities (Intensive Listening, Transcription, Sentence Mining while Listening, even Chorusing) that are all, essentially, the same activities with slight variations or tools. Intensive listening is the base of all of them.","zh":"这其实是一整个活动“家族”（精听、听写、边听边进行句子挖掘，甚至齐声跟读）。本质上，它们都是同一种活动，只是在做法或工具上略有不同。精听是所有这些活动的基础。"}},{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"How It Works","zh":"如何进行"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"en":"Listen to a line of dialogue (auto pause is a helpful feature for this)","zh":"听一句对白（自动暂停功能在这里很有帮助）"},{"en":"Did you understand what was said? If yes, continue and go back to step 1","zh":"你听懂了吗？如果听懂了，就继续播放，然后回到第 1 步"},{"en":"If not, relisten 2-3 times, really focusing on the sounds","zh":"如果没听懂，就再听 2 至 3 遍，把注意力真正集中在声音上"},{"en":"If you still can't understand, reveal the subtitles and check what was said","zh":"如果仍然无法理解，就显示字幕，确认说了什么"},{"en":"Look up any unknown words","zh":"查询所有不认识的词"},{"en":"If you knew all the words but couldn't hear them, relisten with subtitles on until you can match the audio to the text","zh":"如果每个词你都认识，却没能听出来，就打开字幕反复听，直到能将音频与文本对应起来"},{"en":"Turn subtitles off and listen one more time, then move on, going back to step 1","zh":"关闭字幕再听一遍，然后继续播放并回到第 1 步"}]},{"id":"why-it-works","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Why It Works","zh":"为什么有效"}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Intensive listening forces your brain to decode audio without relying on text. The \"relisten before checking\" step is critical — it gives your ears multiple chances to parse the sounds, which builds the neural connections between what you hear and what you know.","zh":"精听迫使大脑在不依赖文本的情况下解码音频。“先重听再查看”的步骤至关重要——它让你的耳朵有多次机会解析声音，从而在听到的内容与已经掌握的知识之间建立神经连接。"}},{"id":"auto-pause","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Auto-pause","zh":"自动暂停"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Many people find auto-pause annoying because it slows everything down. But it forces you to actively process every line instead of letting things wash over you.","zh":"很多人觉得自动暂停很烦，因为它会拖慢整体进度。但它会迫使你主动处理每一句话，而不是任由内容从耳边流过。"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Once you understand over half the lines without needing subtitles, you can turn auto-pause off.","zh":"当你无需字幕就能听懂一半以上的句子时，就可以关闭自动暂停。"}},{"id":"tips","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Tips","zh":"技巧"}},{"id":"segment-0011","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Start with content you've already watched with subtitles — familiarity helps","zh":"从你已经开着字幕看过的内容开始——熟悉感会有所帮助"},{"en":"The process is slow at first. A 20-minute episode might take an hour or longer. That's normal and expected. If it's taking more then 5x the length of the content (a 20-minute episode taking nearly 2 hours), that's a sign the content is probably too hard","zh":"一开始，这个过程会很慢。一集 20 分钟的节目可能需要一小时甚至更久。这很正常，也完全符合预期。如果耗时超过内容本身时长的 5 倍（一集 20 分钟的节目花了将近 2 小时），说明内容可能太难了"},{"en":"As your listening improves, you'll need to pause less and less, until intensive and freeflow listening merge","zh":"随着听力提升，你需要暂停的次数会越来越少，直到精听和顺畅式听力融为一体"},{"en":"The setup for intensive listening is similar to sentence mining — you need a media player with subtitle support and keyboard shortcuts for replaying","zh":"精听所需的配置与句子挖掘相似——你需要一个支持字幕且能用键盘快捷键重播的媒体播放器"}]},{"id":"when-to-start","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"When to Start","zh":"何时开始"}},{"id":"segment-0013","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Intensive listening is the core activity of Phase 3A and continues through Phase 5.","zh":"精听是第 3A 阶段的核心活动，并会一直延续到第 5 阶段。"}}],"cards":[]}}]
